<title>BAHRAIN: ABC Q1 profit rises.</title>
<headline>ABC Q1 profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-05-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>			    (million U.S. dollars)</p>
<p> Net profit		   32   vs	29</p>
<p> Net interest income     123   vs	97</p>
<p> Other income		 59   vs	61</p>
<p> Loan loss provision	29   vs	 6</p>
<p>Full Name: Arab Banking Corporation B.S.C. Note: Shares of the Bahrain-based bank are traded on the Bahraini, Paris and Kuwaiti bourses.</p>
<p>Bahrain newsroom  -973-524424.</p>
